    "Reject file inputs disabled by a parent fieldset; wait for readiness.",
    "Reject an invalid or mismatching response Content-Length before handing bytes to the composer.",
    "Normalize valid hexadecimal token case to the lowercase loopback protocol.",
    "Reject isolated CR/LF characters within HTTP header lines.",
    "Clarify optional extension, explicit handoff click, cancellation and manual fallback in extension README."
  ],
  "verified": [
    "TCP bridge binds only to IPv4 loopback; bearer token expires after 15 minutes.",
    "Only GET /v1/bundle returns a bounded immutable snapshot of the explicitly selected ZIP.",
    "The extension never clicks Send, edits a draft, requests account cookies, or calls a ChatGPT private API.",
    "Closing the panel while awaiting data or changing conversation prevents attachment.",
    "Existing attachments are preserved; an ambiguous/unrelated picker is never selected."
